  "project_description": "Translates untranslated interface strings in batch using the DeepL API or OpenAI API.\n\n This module adds a \"Translate untranslated strings\" link on the Languages page\n\nand runs a batch to translate all missing interface strings from English to the\n\nselected language.\n\n Usage \n - Add API key for DeepL or OpenAI on settings page: /admin/config/regional/interface-translation-auto\n\n- Go on Languages page: /admin/config/regional/language\n\n- Click on link 'Translate untranslated strings' and wait when batch proccess will be finished.",
